    /* M27 (audit 2026-10-10): ONE LOST REPLY IS NOT "NO CALIBRATION". The
       USB link drops about one line in hundreds, and during an eight-minute
       run that pauses the player's controller and mouse, one lost status
       reply drew "update its firmware", stopped asking and took Stop away.
